<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Publisher's Note: Products purchased from Third Party sellers are not guaranteed by the publisher for quality, authenticity, or access to any online entitlements included with the product.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Donâ€™t Let the Real Test Be Your First Test!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Fully updated for the CEH v10 exam objectives, this practical guide contains more than 600 realistic practice exam questions to prepare you for the EC-Councilâ€™s Certified Ethical Hacker exam. To aid in your understanding of the material, in-depth explanations of both the correct and incorrect answers are provided for every question. A valuable pre-assessment test evaluates your readiness and identifies areas requiring further study. Designed to help you pass the exam, this is the perfect companion to &lt;i&gt;CEHâ„¢ Certified Ethical Hacker All-in-One Exam Guide, Fourth Edition.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Covers all exam topics, including:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Ethical hacking fundamentals&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Reconnaissance and footprinting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Scanning and enumeration&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Sniffing and evasion&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Attacking a system&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Hacking web servers and applications&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Wireless network hacking&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Mobile and IoT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Security in cloud computing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Trojans and other attacks&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Cryptography&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Social engineering and physical security&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Penetration testing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Online content includes:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;â€¢Test engine that provides full-length practice exams and customized quizzes by chapter or exam domain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
